WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.750
Ryu uses Drive Impact as Manon waits.

2
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:04.080
Manon answers with her own Drive Impact.

3
00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:04.800
Back heavy punch hits the crumpled opponent.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.850
Medium Renversé catches Ryu after the heavy punch.

5
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:07.800
The hit-grab finish raises Manon from one medal to two.
